cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Inventory and Statistics of GPDVE Collections"
abstract: >-
  A local Streamlit application for consolidating, exploring, and analysing 
  structured archival metadata, enabling transversal statistical generation 
  across collections. Designed for cataloguing and archival description, it 
  supports the management of photographic archives and primary written sources 
  in compliance with national and international archival standards (CONARQ, NOBRADE, ISAD(G)).
authors:
